(1891402, 260548, 20214, '<td valign="top">I''m all for good use of negative space but I think you fall short here. I think a tighter crop would have been in order here. Tighter on the sides and bring the top down to place all of the direction on the glasses. I do however, really like the lighting here.</td>', 'I''m all for good use of negative space but I think you fall short here. I think a tighter crop would have been in order here. Tighter on the sides and bring the top down to place all of the direction on the glasses. I do however, really like the lighting here.', '2005-11-23 01:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
