(1891719, 259790, 39598, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail looked much better on this pic.<br/>In full size it lacks detail, and the highlights are "blown".<br/>In addition it almost looks like the picture is blurry and out of focus.<br/>Fix those things and you may just have a winner next time round!</td>', 'The thumbnail looked much better on this pic.In full size it lacks detail, and the highlights are "blown".In addition it almost looks like the picture is blurry and out of focus.Fix those things and you may just have a winner next time round!', '2005-11-23 05:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891720, 258551, 39598, '<td valign="top">Forgive me, but I find nothing even here at all.<br/>Architecturally even?<br/>Not really, as there is no symmetry to the photo.<br/>That said, I''m loving the effect of the long exposure helping the reflections of light on the water right along.<br/>Good luck with future submissions.</td>', 'Forgive me, but I find nothing even here at all.Architecturally even?Not really, as there is no symmetry to the photo.That said, I''m loving the effect of the long exposure helping the reflections of light on the water right along.Good luck with future submissions.', '2005-11-23 05:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891721, 261025, 47956, '<td valign="top">Kinda Chrismassy ain''t it 7</td>', 'Kinda Chrismassy ain''t it 7', '2005-11-23 05:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891725, 260004, 39598, '<td valign="top">There''s two birds, and that makes the brief fulfilled, certainly.<br/>They just seem to be perched a bit uncomfortably within the picture.<br/>Makes me feel "weird" looking at it.<br/>Like I''m unsettled.<br/>I think that a slightly better choice of composition would have helped the viewer (well, me) feel more at ease within your photo.<br/>That said, I''m impressed at their synchronised preening routine.<br/>Well done on capturing that!</td>', 'There''s two birds, and that makes the brief fulfilled, certainly.They just seem to be perched a bit uncomfortably within the picture.Makes me feel "weird" looking at it.Like I''m unsettled.I think that a slightly better choice of composition would have helped the viewer (well, me) feel more at ease within your photo.That said, I''m impressed at their synchronised preening routine.Well done on capturing that!', '2005-11-23 05:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891728, 260414, 44963, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful image.  Great colour, perfect clarity and so much story.  I envy those who have the skills to capture such opportunities when they arise.  Wow - from me at least.</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful image.  Great colour, perfect clarity and so much story.  I envy those who have the skills to capture such opportunities when they arise.  Wow - from me at least.', '2005-11-23 06:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
