(1891987, 260868, 15711, '<td valign="top">Spelling police here: FAMILY<br/> <br/>That aside, this is interesting. It would work much better if it didn''t have such a centered approach. Maybe have the "family" off to one side. It also seems out of focus.  Bummer, cause I like the idea.</td>', 'Spelling police here: FAMILY That aside, this is interesting. It would work much better if it didn''t have such a centered approach. Maybe have the "family" off to one side. It also seems out of focus.  Bummer, cause I like the idea.', '2005-11-23 09:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891988, 260414, 47205, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors...great capture</td>', 'Wonderful colors...great capture', '2005-11-23 09:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891990, 259730, 10413, '<td valign="top">Great colors. The leaves in front are a little distracting but a great shot anyway.</td>', 'Great colors. The leaves in front are a little distracting but a great shot anyway.', '2005-11-23 09:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891991, 261017, 47205, '<td valign="top">a little too dark in the foreground</td>', 'a little too dark in the foreground', '2005-11-23 09:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891992, 260583, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and cool. Love the texture on the cup - it''s geometric and almost has a heiroglyphic sense.  The tilt works and adds a diagonal line.  That dot in the background - is that the moon???  Great focus. 8</td>', 'This is interesting and cool. Love the texture on the cup - it''s geometric and almost has a heiroglyphic sense.  The tilt works and adds a diagonal line.  That dot in the background - is that the moon???  Great focus. 8', '2005-11-23 09:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891993, 260886, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girls. I''d love to see more formal portraiture of them. This doesn''t do them justice.  WOW - their skin is gorgeous.</td>', 'Beautiful girls. I''d love to see more formal portraiture of them. This doesn''t do them justice.  WOW - their skin is gorgeous.', '2005-11-23 09:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891994, 261025, 47205, '<td valign="top">Nice colors....I won''t ask where this was taken...</td>', 'Nice colors....I won''t ask where this was taken...', '2005-11-23 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891995, 258877, 32084, '<td valign="top">I like this and am scoring it well, but there are odd things about it: only a small fraction feels in focus, I don''t know what it is, and it should either be centered or not and it seems stuck in between, and the top right seems too hot.  However, the title fits as whatever it is feels mechanical, except for the really hot area I really like the b&amp;w, and for some reason even with all of the things above, I really like it.</td>', 'I like this and am scoring it well, but there are odd things about it: only a small fraction feels in focus, I don''t know what it is, and it should either be centered or not and it seems stuck in between, and the top right seems too hot.  However, the title fits as whatever it is feels mechanical, except for the really hot area I really like the b&w, and for some reason even with all of the things above, I really like it.', '2005-11-23 09:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891996, 260710, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I think this could use a tad of curve adjusting. Maybe pan back and not have it so much like a target - yeah, I know, that was probably your intent.  Maybe not cut out the edges of the petals though.</td>', 'Pretty. I think this could use a tad of curve adjusting. Maybe pan back and not have it so much like a target - yeah, I know, that was probably your intent.  Maybe not cut out the edges of the petals though.', '2005-11-23 09:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891998, 258854, 10413, '<td valign="top">Beautiful foggy shot.</td>', 'Beautiful foggy shot.', '2005-11-23 09:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1891999, 260863, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW.  This is fabulous.  The texture in the foreground against the smooth sky  I love the contrast of the black and white.  LOVELY</td>', 'WOW.  This is fabulous.  The texture in the foreground against the smooth sky  I love the contrast of the black and white.  LOVELY', '2005-11-23 09:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892000, 258589, 32084, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  IMO it could be rotated slightly and while I really like the reflection/glint in the water stream, it is distracting on the faucet itself.  Very nice colors.  Right side a little hot.</td>', 'I really like this.  IMO it could be rotated slightly and while I really like the reflection/glint in the water stream, it is distracting on the faucet itself.  Very nice colors.  Right side a little hot.', '2005-11-23 09:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892002, 260769, 15711, '<td valign="top">There is nothing artistic about this shot.  It doesn''t seem esthetically thought out.  It has a blurred snapshot sense to it. Send some time.  Place the objects strategically and make sure your focus is tack sharp.  I''d like a scene similar to this in black and white with lots of negative space. Hope this helps.</td>', 'There is nothing artistic about this shot.  It doesn''t seem esthetically thought out.  It has a blurred snapshot sense to it. Send some time.  Place the objects strategically and make sure your focus is tack sharp.  I''d like a scene similar to this in black and white with lots of negative space. Hope this helps.', '2005-11-23 09:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892004, 260512, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and Im guessing a great adventure to capture.  However, it feels flat.  Possibly some contrast adjustment to bring out the depth, shadows and textures.</td>', 'Nice shot and Im guessing a great adventure to capture.  However, it feels flat.  Possibly some contrast adjustment to bring out the depth, shadows and textures.', '2005-11-23 09:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892007, 259777, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - that''s what I call ripped.<br/> <br/>The angle of the body''s curvature is great.  Nice detail and black and white is perfect.   I wonder if eliminating the face might''ve had more effect. Maybe that''s just me. Nico, is that you?????</td>', 'WOW - that''s what I call ripped. The angle of the body''s curvature is great.  Nice detail and black and white is perfect.   I wonder if eliminating the face might''ve had more effect. Maybe that''s just me. Nico, is that you?????', '2005-11-23 09:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892008, 260414, 47117, '<td valign="top">I only comment on my lowest and highest rated photos.  This is a 10 for me. I like the focus and the colors, and the action of the birds.  There are similar photos to this, but they can''t hold a candle to this one. Good shot.</td>', 'I only comment on my lowest and highest rated photos.  This is a 10 for me. I like the focus and the colors, and the action of the birds.  There are similar photos to this, but they can''t hold a candle to this one. Good shot.', '2005-11-23 09:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892009, 260863, 32084, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great texture, depth and mood.  Only nitpick is the horizon possibly dips to the right.  doesn;t change my socre though.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great texture, depth and mood.  Only nitpick is the horizon possibly dips to the right.  doesn;t change my socre though.  Well done.', '2005-11-23 09:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892012, 259817, 47117, '<td valign="top">I only comment on my highest and lowest scored photos.  This is a 10 for me. I like the focus, the reflection, the title, and it looks nice all the way around.  I just find it very appealing.</td>', 'I only comment on my highest and lowest scored photos.  This is a 10 for me. I like the focus, the reflection, the title, and it looks nice all the way around.  I just find it very appealing.', '2005-11-23 09:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892013, 259980, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWWW those little faces.  I think, even though those blue eyes are really cute, this might be a fun study in black and white.  I wish the fingers weren''t there.  Adorable little kitties.</td>', 'AWWW those little faces.  I think, even though those blue eyes are really cute, this might be a fun study in black and white.  I wish the fingers weren''t there.  Adorable little kitties.', '2005-11-23 09:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892015, 260769, 32084, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  Since the dice are your main subject as indicated by your title, I think they should have been the items in focus.  Also there feels like lots of wasted space on the right.</td>', 'I like the idea.  Since the dice are your main subject as indicated by your title, I think they should have been the items in focus.  Also there feels like lots of wasted space on the right.', '2005-11-23 09:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892019, 258879, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is just stunning.  The rows of tombstones against the beautiful sky with that looming tree. WOW. I love the leading line of it.  Great clarity too. 10 10 10</td>', 'Oh, this is just stunning.  The rows of tombstones against the beautiful sky with that looming tree. WOW. I love the leading line of it.  Great clarity too. 10 10 10', '2005-11-23 09:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892021, 260004, 32084, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Bird shots are really tough.  You did a nice job keeping the light areas away from being blown out which is common, but I feel like both birds should have been sharply focused and any pro bird shooter will advise you to ALWAYS hit a eye glint.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Bird shots are really tough.  You did a nice job keeping the light areas away from being blown out which is common, but I feel like both birds should have been sharply focused and any pro bird shooter will advise you to ALWAYS hit a eye glint.', '2005-11-23 09:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892026, 260673, 47205, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and coloring</td>', 'Wonderful capture and coloring', '2005-11-23 09:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1892027, 260472, 47205, '<td valign="top">Great and very creative</td>', 'Great and very creative', '2005-11-23 09:49:45.000000', NULL, 1);
