(1892255, 261133, 47117, '<td valign="top">I only comment on my lowest and highest voted photos.  I voted this VERY low. Not only is it soliciting votes in an "even" sort of way, but I don''t even find it appealing. There is a mark on her butt that is distracting, and I just find it bland and distasteful. EDITED TO ADD: Once again I cannot reply to your rude message in email, so I will reply here.  Many have voiced wanting to know why they receive ones and twos, and I am complying to the majority. It "is" ironic that in the last two challenges you have received such a score from me, since I vote 2''s not that often, nor do I know who the recipients are.  Whatever the mark is, it is distracting.  Ever hear of makeup?  It''s ok. I can handle the rudeness, but what I said stands true to my word. I just do not like your depiction of the theme and I do find it bland.  Perhaps a black shirt to have matched the shorts or underwear would have faired it better.  Hopefully, in the next challenge, you will receive a high vote from me and finally get some praise.</td>', 'I only comment on my lowest and highest voted photos.  I voted this VERY low. Not only is it soliciting votes in an "even" sort of way, but I don''t even find it appealing. There is a mark on her butt that is distracting, and I just find it bland and distasteful. EDITED TO ADD: Once again I cannot reply to your rude message in email, so I will reply here.  Many have voiced wanting to know why they receive ones and twos, and I am complying to the majority. It "is" ironic that in the last two challenges you have received such a score from me, since I vote 2''s not that often, nor do I know who the recipients are.  Whatever the mark is, it is distracting.  Ever hear of makeup?  It''s ok. I can handle the rudeness, but what I said stands true to my word. I just do not like your depiction of the theme and I do find it bland.  Perhaps a black shirt to have matched the shorts or underwear would have faired it better.  Hopefully, in the next challenge, you will receive a high vote from me and finally get some praise.', '2005-11-23 11:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
