(1893227, 259620, 45790, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photograph. Nice exposure and sharpness. Too much background distraction, and some merging, however.</td>', 'Very interesting photograph. Nice exposure and sharpness. Too much background distraction, and some merging, however.', '2005-11-23 16:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
