(1893233, 261134, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  If only the bird on the right had his feet together as well, that would have been really cool.</td>', 'Nice capture.  If only the bird on the right had his feet together as well, that would have been really cool.', '2005-11-23 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
