(1893238, 259731, 1066, '<td valign="top">My favorite this week.  Very well done technically but I love the contrast and the choice of view and framing is great.<br/> <br/>My only niggle is that it looks a tad soft ( maybe one extra shutter speed level needed) so I held off a 10 but a 9 none the less.</td>', 'My favorite this week.  Very well done technically but I love the contrast and the choice of view and framing is great. My only niggle is that it looks a tad soft ( maybe one extra shutter speed level needed) so I held off a 10 but a 9 none the less.', '2005-11-23 16:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893239, 260886, 45790, '<td valign="top">Look pretty even to me. Nice portrait. Only issue would be non-matching shoes, but you can''t have everything.<br/></td>', 'Look pretty even to me. Nice portrait. Only issue would be non-matching shoes, but you can''t have everything.', '2005-11-23 16:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
