(1893246, 258713, 1066, '<td valign="top">My second most favorite this week.  Why?  Well..it''s obvious..color!<br/> <br/>Great composition, excellent thought, well exposed and nice touch on the backlighting.  I think I may actually steal this idea in a way for an ad I am working on :-D</td>', 'My second most favorite this week.  Why?  Well..it''s obvious..color! Great composition, excellent thought, well exposed and nice touch on the backlighting.  I think I may actually steal this idea in a way for an ad I am working on :-D', '2005-11-23 16:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893247, 260690, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very clever!  Great lighting and focus.</td>', 'Very clever!  Great lighting and focus.', '2005-11-23 16:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893253, 259994, 1066, '<td valign="top">One of my top five.  Has a very impressionistic feel to this.  I am working on a study in impressionism and this is wonderful.  Great colors.  I know some may slam it for the sof focus but thats the point.  right.</td>', 'One of my top five.  Has a very impressionistic feel to this.  I am working on a study in impressionism and this is wonderful.  Great colors.  I know some may slam it for the sof focus but thats the point.  right.', '2005-11-23 16:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893255, 260441, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great illusion - nicely done!</td>', 'Great illusion - nicely done!', '2005-11-23 16:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893259, 260611, 1066, '<td valign="top">One of my top 5 this week.   excellent composition.  I love Black and white and this is a great one.  Especially like the lighting at the top of the tower for effect.</td>', 'One of my top 5 this week.   excellent composition.  I love Black and white and this is a great one.  Especially like the lighting at the top of the tower for effect.', '2005-11-23 16:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893270, 260247, 1066, '<td valign="top">Wow.  When I saw this photo this week I knew it was going to be opne of my favorites!  Simple, elegant, great eye for shape and color.  A little more pop to the sky and this would have been my pick to win this week.  Still one of my top 5.</td>', 'Wow.  When I saw this photo this week I knew it was going to be opne of my favorites!  Simple, elegant, great eye for shape and color.  A little more pop to the sky and this would have been my pick to win this week.  Still one of my top 5.', '2005-11-23 16:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893272, 259410, 45790, '<td valign="top">Looks like you though of everything here, but for the woodgrain :-) Maybe nobody else will see it! High score anyway.</td>', 'Looks like you though of everything here, but for the woodgrain :-) Maybe nobody else will see it! High score anyway.', '2005-11-23 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893276, 260414, 45790, '<td valign="top">Vibrant image with good control of DOF and background.</td>', 'Vibrant image with good control of DOF and background.', '2005-11-23 16:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893278, 258879, 1066, '<td valign="top">Great eye for patterns.  I like the slight pink hue and the overall sense of depth.  One of my top 20.</td>', 'Great eye for patterns.  I like the slight pink hue and the overall sense of depth.  One of my top 20.', '2005-11-23 16:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893283, 260030, 45790, '<td valign="top">Lighting could be better. The uneven lighting has caused blown highlights on three of the four dollars.</td>', 'Lighting could be better. The uneven lighting has caused blown highlights on three of the four dollars.', '2005-11-23 16:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893285, 259891, 1066, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  Great eye for detail and the color is perfect.  Just an excellent example of architectural photography and one of my top 20 this week.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  Great eye for detail and the color is perfect.  Just an excellent example of architectural photography and one of my top 20 this week.', '2005-11-23 16:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
