(1893291, 259731, 46651, '<td valign="top">perfectly balanced image. 8</td>', 'perfectly balanced image. 8', '2005-11-23 16:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893302, 261133, 1066, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm..a bit cheeky aren''t we? :-D<br/> <br/>What wins me over on this photo this week is your use of color..or lack of.  The contrast is excellent, the choice of pose is wonderful and I love the crop.<br/> <br/>One thing.  I loved the shape and color so much I almost wish you didnt have the vote 10 on here :-(  This model has a wonderful shape and the light compliments her skin tone.  Perhaps no "top 10" but show off teh tattoo more.  That brings the shot to a more personal and sensual level.<br/> <br/>Never the less, one of my top 20 this week.</td>', 'Hmmmm..a bit cheeky aren''t we? :-D What wins me over on this photo this week is your use of color..or lack of.  The contrast is excellent, the choice of pose is wonderful and I love the crop. One thing.  I loved the shape and color so much I almost wish you didnt have the vote 10 on here :-(  This model has a wonderful shape and the light compliments her skin tone.  Perhaps no "top 10" but show off teh tattoo more.  That brings the shot to a more personal and sensual level. Never the less, one of my top 20 this week.', '2005-11-23 16:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1893303, 260265, 45790, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the post processing and not sure how this matches the challenge topic.</td>', 'Don''t like the post processing and not sure how this matches the challenge topic.', '2005-11-23 16:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
