(1894756, 258879, 44963, '<td valign="top">I was a little disappointed in this challenge, until I saw your image.  I found it pretty spectacular.  Not only have you really met my interpretation of ''even'' but you have captured the scene beautifully.  The colour of the sky (and clouds) the darkness of the tree and the stark white of the markers.  Great shot.</td>', 'I was a little disappointed in this challenge, until I saw your image.  I found it pretty spectacular.  Not only have you really met my interpretation of ''even'' but you have captured the scene beautifully.  The colour of the sky (and clouds) the darkness of the tree and the stark white of the markers.  Great shot.', '2005-11-24 04:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1894758, 260333, 44963, '<td valign="top">What a face!  A delightful image well taken.  I never seem to be able to get the focus just right when attempting these reflection shots.  You have done well.</td>', 'What a face!  A delightful image well taken.  I never seem to be able to get the focus just right when attempting these reflection shots.  You have done well.', '2005-11-24 04:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
