(1894950, 260472, 24940, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Love the color and depth!  I love stairways and photograph them frequently.  :)</td>', 'Love it!  Love the color and depth!  I love stairways and photograph them frequently.  :)', '2005-11-24 08:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
