(1894970, 260545, 40344, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color, I''d love to see it a bit sharper but excellent none the less. Congratulations</td>', 'Great composition and color, I''d love to see it a bit sharper but excellent none the less. Congratulations', '2005-11-24 08:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
