(1896137, 260414, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot.  Excellent colors and contrast control.  Nice fairly simple background.  Criticism; not much, maybe a little more space on the right, not sure.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Good shot.  Excellent colors and contrast control.  Nice fairly simple background.  Criticism; not much, maybe a little more space on the right, not sure.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2005-11-24 23:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896141, 258713, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Really like this concept, including the reflection.  Criticism; the yellow is competing too much in my opinion with this shot.  Not sure if you focused on the reflection here or not, but I think that if the ''real'' were a bit sharper would have made this even better in my opinion.  To really nit-pick, perfect symmetry would be good too - the ''3'' grips on the handles and the ''lengths'' of the paste/gel.  Not sure on the white frame. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-01 05:22:16.</i></td>', '7 - Really like this concept, including the reflection.  Criticism; the yellow is competing too much in my opinion with this shot.  Not sure if you focused on the reflection here or not, but I think that if the ''real'' were a bit sharper would have made this even better in my opinion.  To really nit-pick, perfect symmetry would be good too - the ''3'' grips on the handles and the ''lengths'' of the paste/gel.  Not sure on the white frame. edit:typo', '2005-11-24 23:27:42.000000', '2005-12-01 05:22:16.000000', 1),
(1896143, 260863, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image..the sky and sea are evenly divided and equally interesting..well composed and beautifully executed.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image..the sky and sea are evenly divided and equally interesting..well composed and beautifully executed.', '2005-11-24 23:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896147, 261060, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Good colors.  Criticism; difficult, especially for the Challenge (as you''ve obviously centered the ''6th''), but like to see the interesting pattern on the petals more, so maybe a slightly different crop.  A little sharper too, albeit difficult, may have made this even better.  Not sure on the white frame.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Good colors.  Criticism; difficult, especially for the Challenge (as you''ve obviously centered the ''6th''), but like to see the interesting pattern on the petals more, so maybe a slightly different crop.  A little sharper too, albeit difficult, may have made this even better.  Not sure on the white frame.', '2005-11-24 23:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896150, 259801, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good ''catch''.  Criticism; not much, I like the unusual effect on the water - maybe a toning or b/w would have worked to add drama here, not sure.  Not sure on the frame either.</td>', '7 - Good ''catch''.  Criticism; not much, I like the unusual effect on the water - maybe a toning or b/w would have worked to add drama here, not sure.  Not sure on the frame either.', '2005-11-24 23:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896157, 261158, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good idea.  Criticism; just needs something ''extra'' in my opinion, maybe the lighting, angle/perspective, not sure.</td>', '7 - Good idea.  Criticism; just needs something ''extra'' in my opinion, maybe the lighting, angle/perspective, not sure.', '2005-11-24 23:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896160, 260545, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Nice and simple.  Criticism; difficult perhaps, but even ''crisper'' focus, especially around the eyes, would have made this even better in my opinion.  Maybe also a slightly different crop, more at the top, depending what you had to work with.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Good.  Nice and simple.  Criticism; difficult perhaps, but even ''crisper'' focus, especially around the eyes, would have made this even better in my opinion.  Maybe also a slightly different crop, more at the top, depending what you had to work with.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2005-11-24 23:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896166, 258879, 34763, '<td valign="top">Indeed an eye catching photo with the brillance of the sunset over the honored fallen. You have more than met the challenge and exceeded in artistic qualities!</td>', 'Indeed an eye catching photo with the brillance of the sunset over the honored fallen. You have more than met the challenge and exceeded in artistic qualities!', '2005-11-24 23:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896227, 259909, 47557, '<td valign="top">Having worked with these for a good while, I find the extended title extraneous.  Photo itself is wonderfully rich in colour, there''s great refraction of the bubble.  Hardly something I expected to consider beautiful - mostly beat up and dirty!  Nice use of the tools natural symmetry to reinforce the theme.</td>', 'Having worked with these for a good while, I find the extended title extraneous.  Photo itself is wonderfully rich in colour, there''s great refraction of the bubble.  Hardly something I expected to consider beautiful - mostly beat up and dirty!  Nice use of the tools natural symmetry to reinforce the theme.', '2005-11-25 00:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896230, 260030, 47557, '<td valign="top">Choice of subject is odd - 5 points to each.  Arrangement doesn''t reinforce the theme.</td>', 'Choice of subject is odd - 5 points to each.  Arrangement doesn''t reinforce the theme.', '2005-11-25 00:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896236, 260545, 47557, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, measured, numbered, good lines and balance.</td>', 'Beautiful, measured, numbered, good lines and balance.', '2005-11-25 00:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896238, 260875, 47557, '<td valign="top">Almost too contrived, while a pair is even, the arrangement isn''t - and the photo seems so clinical as to request nit-picking.</td>', 'Almost too contrived, while a pair is even, the arrangement isn''t - and the photo seems so clinical as to request nit-picking.', '2005-11-25 01:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896242, 260583, 47557, '<td valign="top">Technically tricky shot - and I''m surprised at the odd angle chosen in this challenge!  It does lead to a fuller feeling frame, but I''d enjoy an un-rotated alternate cropping.</td>', 'Technically tricky shot - and I''m surprised at the odd angle chosen in this challenge!  It does lead to a fuller feeling frame, but I''d enjoy an un-rotated alternate cropping.', '2005-11-25 01:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896247, 258713, 47557, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colours, great symmetry - that''s personal taste coming through.  Excellent use of reflection, background choice.</td>', 'Vibrant colours, great symmetry - that''s personal taste coming through.  Excellent use of reflection, background choice.', '2005-11-25 01:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896304, 260652, 36808, '<td valign="top">Like it but wish it could''ve been a litle sharper (it looks a bit blurry to me)</td>', 'Like it but wish it could''ve been a litle sharper (it looks a bit blurry to me)', '2005-11-25 02:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
