(1896311, 260910, 46758, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. Too bad there is so many noise and grain  in the lower half. Else I would have given it a 10, now you will have to do with a 7.</td>', 'Love the idea. Too bad there is so many noise and grain  in the lower half. Else I would have given it a 10, now you will have to do with a 7.', '2005-11-25 02:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
