(1896431, 260652, 45857, '<td valign="top">Yes, 4 cars (Corvettes?) which makes it even, but the way they''re shown with the hoods (bonnets) open certainly is odd. The image does appear a little soft to me, nothing is quit focused.</td>', 'Yes, 4 cars (Corvettes?) which makes it even, but the way they''re shown with the hoods (bonnets) open certainly is odd. The image does appear a little soft to me, nothing is quit focused.', '2005-11-25 07:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
