(1896439, 261154, 45857, '<td valign="top">Certainly a precious family moment, I love the rolled cuffs. I would like to see the color version, just to know how well the b&amp;W works here, it does give it that 50''s snapshot feel.</td>', 'Certainly a precious family moment, I love the rolled cuffs. I would like to see the color version, just to know how well the b&W works here, it does give it that 50''s snapshot feel.', '2005-11-25 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
