(1896458, 260598, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I like the colors, especially the blues. Perhaps a slightly different perspective would have yielded a more symmetrical image.</td>', 'Nice idea, I like the colors, especially the blues. Perhaps a slightly different perspective would have yielded a more symmetrical image.', '2005-11-25 08:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
