(1896466, 260436, 45857, '<td valign="top">Yep, 2 eyes, but its odd enough that I don''t know what it is... lol<br/>It seems to be a good shot.</td>', 'Yep, 2 eyes, but its odd enough that I don''t know what it is... lolIt seems to be a good shot.', '2005-11-25 08:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896468, 260769, 45857, '<td valign="top">I do think this would have been better if something had been in focus.</td>', 'I do think this would have been better if something had been in focus.', '2005-11-25 08:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1896472, 260617, 45857, '<td valign="top">I will give extra credit for not using a craps theme. Your image does seem ''soft'' for some reason, perhaps its the poor contrast on the dice, the gold just doesn''t want to stand out for me.</td>', 'I will give extra credit for not using a craps theme. Your image does seem ''soft'' for some reason, perhaps its the poor contrast on the dice, the gold just doesn''t want to stand out for me.', '2005-11-25 08:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
