(1896492, 261119, 45857, '<td valign="top">AGGGH! DICE!!!!! (sorry)<br/>Lighting is good, perhaps more carefull stacking and more even crop might of helped.</td>', 'AGGGH! DICE!!!!! (sorry)Lighting is good, perhaps more carefull stacking and more even crop might of helped.', '2005-11-25 08:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
