(1897062, 258607, 45857, '<td valign="top">Peace and wisdom for all who seek it.</td>', 'Peace and wisdom for all who seek it.', '2005-11-25 16:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897079, 261017, 43031, '<td valign="top">You really need to calibrate your monitor, I''m viewing this on a monitor where I usually find most pics too bright, but I can barely see the rails here. I think this could possibly have been a great photo minus that problem.</td>', 'You really need to calibrate your monitor, I''m viewing this on a monitor where I usually find most pics too bright, but I can barely see the rails here. I think this could possibly have been a great photo minus that problem.', '2005-11-25 16:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897090, 260543, 41574, '<td valign="top">It''s not a bad picture, but it really doesn''t fit the challenge. Sorry, but the title just seems like a desperate stretch to make it work, and even then, it''s "UNeven."</td>', 'It''s not a bad picture, but it really doesn''t fit the challenge. Sorry, but the title just seems like a desperate stretch to make it work, and even then, it''s "UNeven."', '2005-11-25 16:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897091, 260598, 41574, '<td valign="top">It looks a bit slanted, but, still, good shot.</td>', 'It looks a bit slanted, but, still, good shot.', '2005-11-25 16:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897092, 259836, 41574, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2005-11-25 16:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897124, 260910, 45857, '<td valign="top">You pose an interesting theological dichotomy, but it appears through your uneven presentation. You elevated the spirital above the materalistic and symbolicly represented it 3 to 1. Sorry, just my interpretation. Also you image has a strange distracting red grain.</td>', 'You pose an interesting theological dichotomy, but it appears through your uneven presentation. You elevated the spirital above the materalistic and symbolicly represented it 3 to 1. Sorry, just my interpretation. Also you image has a strange distracting red grain.', '2005-11-25 17:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897144, 259796, 32084, '<td valign="top">What a neat photo.  I am just wondering here if a slightly different angle could have allowed you to crop tighter at the top left - with that and maybe a little different time of day this could provoke all sorts of mystery and possibly even the proverbial rabbit hole notion.  P.S. I hope nobody battles you on the 0 being even concept as Im sure many might consider it.</td>', 'What a neat photo.  I am just wondering here if a slightly different angle could have allowed you to crop tighter at the top left - with that and maybe a little different time of day this could provoke all sorts of mystery and possibly even the proverbial rabbit hole notion.  P.S. I hope nobody battles you on the 0 being even concept as Im sure many might consider it.', '2005-11-25 17:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897150, 259789, 45857, '<td valign="top">Like your straight row and the way you got them all the same height.</td>', 'Like your straight row and the way you got them all the same height.', '2005-11-25 17:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897157, 259392, 32084, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful concept and photo.  I do wonder though if it was originally shot a little too soft and required excessive sharpening as the rounded edges have become jagged, particularly underneath the upper set of arms and the lower right portion of the gown.</td>', 'This is a beautiful concept and photo.  I do wonder though if it was originally shot a little too soft and required excessive sharpening as the rounded edges have become jagged, particularly underneath the upper set of arms and the lower right portion of the gown.', '2005-11-25 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897159, 261082, 32084, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  I wonder if as your title says "grpahic balance" was sought, why not line up the b&amp;w squares?  Also, what kind of impact did it have if it wasnlt quite so hot on the lower left?</td>', 'Very cool idea.  I wonder if as your title says "grpahic balance" was sought, why not line up the b&w squares?  Also, what kind of impact did it have if it wasnlt quite so hot on the lower left?', '2005-11-25 17:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897164, 261134, 32084, '<td valign="top">I love bird shots.  You have done well to capture the always important eye glint on the foreground bird, but as the pro bird shooters will say the shot is way over-exposed as the whites are blown and all detail is lost.  These are very tough shots and this is a good effort.</td>', 'I love bird shots.  You have done well to capture the always important eye glint on the foreground bird, but as the pro bird shooters will say the shot is way over-exposed as the whites are blown and all detail is lost.  These are very tough shots and this is a good effort.', '2005-11-25 17:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897166, 261004, 45857, '<td valign="top">Great camouflage, nice pair.</td>', 'Great camouflage, nice pair.', '2005-11-25 17:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897169, 261142, 43148, '<td valign="top">pretty birds and as I am sure there was a reason to cut off their feet, will not complain too much, but do wish that you could have shown all of the birds</td>', 'pretty birds and as I am sure there was a reason to cut off their feet, will not complain too much, but do wish that you could have shown all of the birds', '2005-11-25 17:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897170, 260875, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and interesting colors</td>', 'Nice composition and interesting colors', '2005-11-25 17:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897173, 261004, 43148, '<td valign="top">background is a tad too busy - wish the fence was not there at all, but not much you could do about that</td>', 'background is a tad too busy - wish the fence was not there at all, but not much you could do about that', '2005-11-25 17:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1897177, 260673, 43148, '<td valign="top">nicely done,</td>', 'nicely done,', '2005-11-25 17:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
