(1905410, 260775, 41800, '<td valign="top">I find money never photographs well. It hard to get it as sharp as one would like with out over sharpening. Your money look like it was taken in incandecent light and was not white balanced or leveled in the post process. Otherwise I like the perfectly black background.  The composition and idea are good.</td>', 'I find money never photographs well. It hard to get it as sharp as one would like with out over sharpening. Your money look like it was taken in incandecent light and was not white balanced or leveled in the post process. Otherwise I like the perfectly black background.  The composition and idea are good.', '2005-11-29 20:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
