(1905814, 259392, 43115, '<td valign="top">This could have been a ''10'' but  I think you used too much USM, or some other sharpening tool, as the edges of the statue are glowing and ragged.  Too bad, because it detracts heavily from the capture.</td>', 'This could have been a ''10'' but  I think you used too much USM, or some other sharpening tool, as the edges of the statue are glowing and ragged.  Too bad, because it detracts heavily from the capture.', '2005-11-29 22:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905817, 260548, 29009, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning - composition is perfect, right down to the level of wine in the glasses.  Lighting is excellent - no hot spots on the glassware.  Sharpness is spot-on, love the element of reflection.  Lotsa visual appeal here!  (10)</td>', 'Simply stunning - composition is perfect, right down to the level of wine in the glasses.  Lighting is excellent - no hot spots on the glassware.  Sharpness is spot-on, love the element of reflection.  Lotsa visual appeal here!  (10)', '2005-11-29 22:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905821, 261010, 43115, '<td valign="top">There is a haunting look in those eyes.  It''s actually a little troubling, as you want babies to be cute and happy, not as <i>intense</i> as this expression is.  Great lighting and critically sharp.</td>', 'There is a haunting look in those eyes.  It''s actually a little troubling, as you want babies to be cute and happy, not as intense as this expression is.  Great lighting and critically sharp.', '2005-11-29 22:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
