(1905888, 260598, 43115, '<td valign="top">I like the moody lighting of this shot.   Almost looks like something you would see in a club or a trendy bar.  Well done.  However, the overexposed highlights do detract somewhat from the mood that you built up so well with the rest of the shot.</td>', 'I like the moody lighting of this shot.   Almost looks like something you would see in a club or a trendy bar.  Well done.  However, the overexposed highlights do detract somewhat from the mood that you built up so well with the rest of the shot.', '2005-11-29 23:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
