(1905892, 261133, 43115, '<td valign="top">I actually chuckled at this one.  Good entry, good model, good pose, good idea.  This should be a little thing, but I really don''t like the ring on the model''s left hand, and I would have asked her to remove it.  I do wonder what this would have looked like in color... if you had some red panties, the pop of color would have been dynamic.</td>', 'I actually chuckled at this one.  Good entry, good model, good pose, good idea.  This should be a little thing, but I really don''t like the ring on the model''s left hand, and I would have asked her to remove it.  I do wonder what this would have looked like in color... if you had some red panties, the pop of color would have been dynamic.', '2005-11-29 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905894, 260811, 43115, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this shot.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this shot.', '2005-11-29 23:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905895, 260414, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, Love the colors and the playfulness of this picture. Nice details.</td>', 'Very good shot, Love the colors and the playfulness of this picture. Nice details.', '2005-11-29 23:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905900, 261157, 43115, '<td valign="top">A GREAT motion stop picture.  I love the blurred background (I''m assuming you panned with the horses), as it really makes you FEEL the motion.<br/> <br/>However, the misspelled title suggests that you didn''t put much thought into it... which I know isn''t true.  Even if English isn''t your native language, it''s important that the title be correct.  Check out dictionary.com if you''re ever in doubt.  :)</td>', 'A GREAT motion stop picture.  I love the blurred background (I''m assuming you panned with the horses), as it really makes you FEEL the motion. However, the misspelled title suggests that you didn''t put much thought into it... which I know isn''t true.  Even if English isn''t your native language, it''s important that the title be correct.  Check out dictionary.com if you''re ever in doubt.  :)', '2005-11-29 23:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905901, 259730, 43115, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the symmetry and the DOF... heck, I love everything about this shot!</td>', 'I love the color and the symmetry and the DOF... heck, I love everything about this shot!', '2005-11-29 23:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905902, 260094, 43115, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasty colors of this, and the inked ruler is great.  Most people would stop at an even number of even numbered blocks, but the even height takes it one step further.  The ink ruler is simple and effective... it says just enough, without saying too little.  Good job!</td>', 'I love the contrasty colors of this, and the inked ruler is great.  Most people would stop at an even number of even numbered blocks, but the even height takes it one step further.  The ink ruler is simple and effective... it says just enough, without saying too little.  Good job!', '2005-11-29 23:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1905907, 260414, 43115, '<td valign="top">I absolutley love the color of this shot.  And the sharpness... wow!<br/> <br/>I''m sure there was some post processing done here, but whatever you did, remember it and keep doing it.  Great job.<br/> <br/>It doesn''t have the strongest link to the challenge, but it''s such a technically great shot that I''ll forgive that. :)</td>', 'I absolutley love the color of this shot.  And the sharpness... wow! I''m sure there was some post processing done here, but whatever you did, remember it and keep doing it.  Great job. It doesn''t have the strongest link to the challenge, but it''s such a technically great shot that I''ll forgive that. :)', '2005-11-29 23:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
