(1906056, 261157, 16106, '<td valign="top">Love those last minute entries, if you don''t submit the wrong photo you spell the title wrong. Oh well.<br/> <br/> Some folks saw the vague blurs as smudges or reflections off a window; Ugly as they are, I disavow most of the blame as they are the vertical elements of the rails, blured into vagueness, I tried to pan even further to lessen them, but couldn''t hold the pan that long.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-30 00:37:56.</i></td>', 'Love those last minute entries, if you don''t submit the wrong photo you spell the title wrong. Oh well.  Some folks saw the vague blurs as smudges or reflections off a window; Ugly as they are, I disavow most of the blame as they are the vertical elements of the rails, blured into vagueness, I tried to pan even further to lessen them, but couldn''t hold the pan that long.', '2005-11-30 00:35:25.000000', '2005-11-30 00:37:56.000000', 0),
