(1906372, 261154, 44860, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Evaan:</b></div><hr/><i> Great capture! Makes me smile. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Exactly! I adore children, so I enjoy seeing photos like this one. Composition is original (showing children from behind), mood and message is undoubtly subtle, warm and sweet. <br/> <br/>OK, technically the picture isn''t perfect, but it delivers a big load of positive emotions. I would really like to see this picture higher in ranking list, and more of such interesting pictures in DPC.</td>', 'Originally posted by Evaan: Great capture! Makes me smile.  Exactly! I adore children, so I enjoy seeing photos like this one. Composition is original (showing children from behind), mood and message is undoubtly subtle, warm and sweet.  OK, technically the picture isn''t perfect, but it delivers a big load of positive emotions. I would really like to see this picture higher in ranking list, and more of such interesting pictures in DPC.', '2005-11-30 01:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
