(1906676, 260736, 19880, '<td valign="top">Contrary to a couple comments, the original picture IS in focus (look at the rock), and the ducks are sharp and clear.  I''m thinking it may look a little soft because I used a pretty poor-quality lens (all I can afford at this point).  I think I may have used a slight unsharp-mask, but I do not like the look of over-sharpened images (which there are plenty of on this site).  All the same, the comments are helpful.  Cheers.</td>', 'Contrary to a couple comments, the original picture IS in focus (look at the rock), and the ducks are sharp and clear.  I''m thinking it may look a little soft because I used a pretty poor-quality lens (all I can afford at this point).  I think I may have used a slight unsharp-mask, but I do not like the look of over-sharpened images (which there are plenty of on this site).  All the same, the comments are helpful.  Cheers.', '2005-11-30 03:24:14.000000', NULL, 0),
