(2847646, 260886, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think of this as an homage to Diane Arbus''s famous photo of twins. Here, there is a more conscious effort to bring out the dark side (the severe expressions and the distortion of their bodies through foreshortening), which actually makes it more fun than the original (of course, Arbus was not trying to have fun!). I love this.</td>', 'I think of this as an homage to Diane Arbus''s famous photo of twins. Here, there is a more conscious effort to bring out the dark side (the severe expressions and the distortion of their bodies through foreshortening), which actually makes it more fun than the original (of course, Arbus was not trying to have fun!). I love this.', '2006-09-19 14:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
